{"title":"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_6\">Problem 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Charles has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/3/9c3cf0ad8cd09b9788ba15abfc4a29496736a300.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5q + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"48\" height=\"16\" /> quarters and Richard has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/9/5693e5be73c5d0fc8113648e11a15322c1c88de0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"39\" height=\"16\" /> quarters. The difference in their money in dimes is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/3/6339bf5253e792b21013d03f34e77470efea75f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 10(q - 1) \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac {2}{5}(4q - 4) \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac {2}{5}(q - 1) \\\\  \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{5}{2}(q-1)\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"384\" height=\"75\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If Charles has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/a/63a53d093d36fb26ae4edb92f6d9f8053bf01511.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5q +1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"48\" height=\"16\" /> quarters and Richard has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/4/f541040fbf300f3f69c444f3907fd24f2a3d95c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q+5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"39\" height=\"16\" /> quarters, then the difference between them is  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/e/99e9e04d39096403da54b523130ae7a1f3d6af79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4q-4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"49\" height=\"15\" /> quarters. Converting quarters to dimes, the difference between them is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/8/14845c315631db1590356e983dfc22511fc32d0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{2}\\cdot (4)(q-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"102\" height=\"37\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/0/050b23e4bebdac29d88cc1939116df2a8b05b73e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10(q-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"70\" height=\"18\" /> dimes, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/a/53aec19270c6c5958bae11885400f9a76c290a4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\implies \\fbox{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"68\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> does not stand for the number of quarters that they have.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME\" title=\"1953 AHSME\">1953 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b